<title>NETHERLANDS: ATAG Q3 PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>ATAG Q3 PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atag Holding NV said on Friday it posted a net profit of 1.3 million guilders in the third quarter of 1996 versus 4.5 million guilders in the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>Atag said the sector Home products was under pressure as margins in kitchenware were under pressure, due to overcapacity and less demand, especially from Germany.</p>
<p>Atag said the starting up costs with the production of a new CV-kettle put also pressure on profits.</p>
<p>Atag Cycle Group increased turnover and profits in the first nine months, the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
